  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside an immortal battlefield, Lu Wei Yin activates the killer move against Fang Yuan’s sword dragons. Sand rains in a torrent, the battlefield makes the sand heavier, and in a few breaths the dragons shrink into white earthworms the size of a human arm. Fang Yuan’s methods become very weak under the sand. Descending sand then works with two other rank eight killer moves, mud piled into a wall and six directional maze; the three fuse into fetus earth maze, a huge maze that envelops Fang Yuan. Attacks that land on the maze’s yellow walls become extremely weak because those walls carry descending sand’s effect.",
